course: dictionary
lesson: 1074
title: Words for the inside of the body
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A word can mean one thing in a science book and another thing in a story. Read the sentence and the words around it to find out which meaning fits. «The bowel is part of the digestive system.» Here the bowel is a body part, a long tube below the stomach.
explain: Doctors sometimes use special words. «Bowel movement» is the doctor's polite word for a poo. The clue is that the doctor is talking about the body, so the word is about the body too.
explain: The same word can also point deep inside something that is not a body. «The bowels of the ship» means the deepest, darkest inside part of the ship. Ask yourself: is the sentence about a body, or about a place? The clues will tell you.
fact: The bowel is a long tube in the body, below the stomach.
fact: Bowel is also called the intestines.
fact: Food is digested in the bowel, and waste is formed there.
fact: «Bowels» in the plural can mean the inside of the body's gut.
fact: «The bowels of the earth» means the deepest inside part of the earth.
exercise: «The bowel is part of the digestive system.» What is the bowel? | *A long tube in the body below the stomach | A small room for sleeping | A bone in the arm | A kind of bird
exercise: «The bowels of the ship were dark and quiet.» What do bowels mean here? | The top deck, open to the sky | The sails and the flags | The name of the captain | *The deepest inside part of the ship
exercise: The doctor says, «Bowel movement». What does it mean? | *A poo, the doctor's polite word | A swimming lesson | A type of exercise | A big wave in the sea
test: What is another name for the intestines? | Heart | *Bowel | Stomach | Lungs
test: «The old mine went down into the bowels of the earth.» Where did the mine go? | Up into the clouds | *Deep inside the ground | Along the beach | Across the sea
exam: Which sentence uses bowel as a part of the body? | *The large bowel helps to digest food | The bowels of the earth are hot | The ship had deep bowels full of cargo | The bowels of the castle were dark
